, and how managed services are priced.\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"AI marketing automation India,AI outreach agent,GTM for startups,WhatsApp sales automation,AI sales agent SMB India\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://nebulaa.ai\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Nebulaa — Company Facts\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Canonical facts about Nebulaa: what it is, where it is, the two products and their prices, the channels it runs, and how managed services are priced.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@nebulaaai\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Nebulaa.ai — AI Marketing &amp; Outreach for Founders\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Two AI agents. Your entire GTM. Automated.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500;1,600&amp;family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Nebulaa\",\"legalName\":\"Noburo Business Services LLP\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai\",\"email\":\"hello@nebulaa.ai\",\"description\":\"Nebulaa is a Chennai-based AI marketing company. It builds two agents — Gravity for marketing and Pulsar for outreach — and runs managed marketing engagements for brands across South India.\",\"foundingDate\":\"2025\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Chennai\",\"addressRegion\":\"Tamil Nadu\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"India\"},\"makesOffer\":[{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Gravity\",\"price\":\"10000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Gravity\",\"description\":\"Reads a website and builds a marketing strategy from it, plans the month, drafts posts, carousels and reels, tracks competitors, runs campaigns and creator collaborations, and handles the social inbox.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Pulsar\",\"price\":\"15000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Pulsar\",\"description\":\"Answers enquiries on WhatsApp, email and SMS within minutes, qualifies budget, timeline and fit, scores every lead, and runs broadcasts, automation and voice calling.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Both agents\",\"price\":\"20000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Both agents\",\"description\":\"Gravity and Pulsar on one account, sharing the same brand memory.\"}}]}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"bg-ground text-ink font-body antialiased\"><nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 border-b border-rule transition-all duration-300 bg-ground/80 backdrop-blur-sm\" style=\"transform:translateY(-64px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between py-7 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><a class=\"flex-shrink-0\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Nebulaa.ai\" fetchPriority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-10 w-auto hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity dark:hidden\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fetchPriority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-10 w-auto hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity brightness-110 hidden dark:block\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75\"/></a><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-[38px]\"><div class=\"relative\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Product<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><a class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\" href=\"/channels\">Channels<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><a class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\" href=\"/services\">Services<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\">Pricing<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><div class=\"relative\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Resources<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3.5\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Sign in</a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"font-body text-sm font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black rounded-full px-[22px] py-[11px] shadow-[0_4px_18px_rgba(245,166,35,0.20)] hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-all\">Start free</a></div><div class=\"md:hidden flex items-center gap-2\"><button class=\"text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></nav><main class=\"bg-ground text-ink min-h-screen\"><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pt-[140px] pb-[70px] max-w-[860px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[26px] block\">Company facts</span><h1 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[38px] md:text-[56px] leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-[24px]\" style=\"text-wrap:pretty\">Everything true about us,<!-- --> <span class=\"italic text-gold-display\">on one page.</span></h1><p class=\"text-[17px] leading-[1.65] text-muted max-w-[640px]\">Pricing, products, location and capabilities, stated once. If a figure appears anywhere else on this site, it comes from here — so a summary of us should never find two different answers to the same question.</p></section><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pb-[70px]\"><dl class=\"max-w-[860px] border-t border-rule\"><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-[190px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-8 gap-y-1.5 py-4 border-b border-rule\"><dt class=\"neb-label pt-1\">What it is</dt><dd class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.65] text-ink-2\">Nebulaa is a Chennai-based AI marketing company. It builds two agents — Gravity for marketing and Pulsar for outreach — and runs managed marketing engagements for brands across South India.</dd></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-[190px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-8 gap-y-1.5 py-4 border-b border-rule\"><dt class=\"neb-label pt-1\">Legal entity</dt><dd class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.65] text-ink-2\">Noburo Business Services LLP</dd></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-[190px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-8 gap-y-1.5 py-4 border-b border-rule\"><dt class=\"neb-label pt-1\">Location</dt><dd class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.65] text-ink-2\">Chennai<!-- -->, <!-- -->Tamil Nadu<!-- -->, India</dd></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-[190px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-8 gap-y-1.5 py-4 border-b border-rule\"><dt class=\"neb-label pt-1\">Contact</dt><dd class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.65] text-ink-2\"><a href=\"mailto:hello@nebulaa.ai\" class=\"text-gold-text hover:underline\">hello@nebulaa.ai</a></dd></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-[190px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-8 gap-y-1.5 py-4 border-b border-rule\"><dt class=\"neb-label pt-1\">Products</dt><dd class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.65] text-ink-2\">Gravity (marketing) and Pulsar (outreach)</dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pb-[70px]\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[26px] md:text-[32px] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-6\">Software pricing</h2><div class=\"max-w-[860px] overflow-x-auto border border-rule rounded-[16px] bg-surface\"><table class=\"w-full min-w-[520px] border-collapse text-[15px]\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><th class=\"neb-label font-normal text-left px-6 py-3.5\">Plan</th><th class=\"neb-label font-normal text-left px-6 py-3.5\">Price / month</th><th class=\"neb-label font-normal text-left px-6 py-3.5\">What it is</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-rule last:border-b-0 align-top\"><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-ink font-medium whitespace-nowrap\">Gravity</td><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-ink-2 tabular-nums whitespace-nowrap\">₹<!-- -->10,000</td><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-muted text-[14px] leading-[1.6]\">Reads a website and builds a marketing strategy from it, plans the month, drafts posts, carousels and reels, tracks competitors, runs campaigns and creator collaborations, and handles the social inbox.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule last:border-b-0 align-top\"><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-ink font-medium whitespace-nowrap\">Pulsar</td><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-ink-2 tabular-nums whitespace-nowrap\">₹<!-- -->15,000</td><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-muted text-[14px] leading-[1.6]\">Answers enquiries on WhatsApp, email and SMS within minutes, qualifies budget, timeline and fit, scores every lead, and runs broadcasts, automation and voice calling.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule last:border-b-0 align-top\"><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-ink font-medium whitespace-nowrap\">Both agents</td><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-ink-2 tabular-nums whitespace-nowrap\">₹<!-- -->20,000</td><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-muted text-[14px] leading-[1.6]\">Gravity and Pulsar on one account, sharing the same brand memory.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-[14px] text-faint mt-3\">All prices in Indian rupees, per month. Seven-day free trial, no card required.</p></section><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pb-[70px] max-w-[860px]\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[26px] md:text-[32px] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-5\">Managed services pricing</h2><p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-muted\">Managed services are scoped and quoted per engagement. No standard price is published, because a single-city content engagement and a multi-market regional programme are not the same job. Media spend and creator fees are billed at actuals and never marked up.</p></section><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pb-[70px]\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[26px] md:text-[32px] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-6\">Channels</h2><dl class=\"max-w-[860px] border-t border-rule\"><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-[190px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-8 gap-y-1.5 py-4 border-b border-rule\"><dt class=\"neb-label pt-1\">Published by Gravity</dt><dd class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.65] text-ink-2\">Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn, X, YouTube Shorts</dd></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-[190px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-8 gap-y-1.5 py-4 border-b border-rule\"><dt class=\"neb-label pt-1\">Handled by Pulsar</dt><dd class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.65] text-ink-2\">WhatsApp, Email, SMS, Voice</dd></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-[190px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-8 gap-y-1.5 py-4 border-b border-rule\"><dt class=\"neb-label pt-1\">Run by the team</dt><dd class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.65] text-ink-2\">Google Business Profile; Pinterest; Meta and Google Ads; Quick commerce — Zepto, Blinkit, Swiggy Instamart</dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pb-[110px] max-w-[860px]\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[26px] md:text-[32px] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-6\">What we do</h2><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 pl-5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-[9px] w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold\"></span>Marketing strategy, positioning and content planning</li><li class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 pl-5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-[9px] w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold\"></span>Social content production — posts, carousels, short-form video</li><li class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 pl-5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-[9px] w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold\"></span>Photography, brand films and product stories</li><li class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 pl-5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-[9px] w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold\"></span>Performance marketing on Meta and Google, geo-targeted</li><li class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 pl-5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-[9px] w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold\"></span>Regional influencer and creator collaborations</li><li class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 pl-5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-[9px] w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold\"></span>BTL and on-ground activation — sampling, in-store demos, retail activation</li><li class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 pl-5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-[9px] w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold\"></span>Quick-commerce listing optimisation and discovery campaigns</li><li class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 pl-5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-[9px] w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold\"></span>Distribution enablement — introductions, not appointment or negotiation</li><li class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 pl-5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-[9px] w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold\"></span>Monthly reporting across organic, paid, creator and on-ground activity</li></ul><p class=\"text-[14px] leading-[1.65] text-faint mt-9\">We do not publish client growth figures. They go up when there is client work published with permission behind it — see<!-- --> <a class=\"text-gold-text hover:underline\" href=\"/work\">engagements</a> <!-- -->for what we can describe today.</p></section></main><footer class=\"relative border-t border-rule pt-[60px] pb-[50px] px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-[50px] lg:gap-[70px]\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-[10px] mb-4\"><div class=\"w-[17px] h-[17px] rounded-full flex-shrink-0\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 34% 32%, #FFD48A 0%, #F5A623 46%, #A4650B 100%)\"></div><span class=\"font-heading text-[17px] font-normal text-ink\">Nebulaa</span></div><div class=\"font-body text-[13px] text-muted leading-[1.7]\">Chennai, India<br/><a href=\"mailto:hello@nebulaa.ai\" class=\"hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">hello@nebulaa.ai</a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-[70px] gap-y-[40px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[11px]\"><span class=\"